        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MangaCo</strong> – The Ultimate Creative Companion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn Every Input Into Artistic Progress!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most responsive desktop idler! <strong>MangaCo</strong> transforms <strong>any input device</strong> into creative energy – whether you're typing a document, sketching on your tablet, playing music, or just browsing the web, your actions power your manga artist's productivity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go full turbo-mode or relax and let automation handle slow periods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☕ Cozy Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw manga in various genres earning <strong>money</strong>, <strong>achievements</strong> and growing your <strong>collection</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way to make a great piece or just use a bit of <strong>luck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet oddly specific requirements to find the <strong>secrets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Character &amp; Environment Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine <strong>mangaka styles</strong> from shonen action to cozy slice-of-life aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong> your workspace with different themed items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>trophies</strong> for different <strong>achievements</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚀 Always-On Productivity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always visible</strong> above other windows</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable window size</strong> to match your workflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable position</strong> on your screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance optimized</strong> to run smoothly alongside other apps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Universal Input Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drawing Tablet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIDI Devices</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Transform Your Computer Time Into Creative Energy!</strong></p>",
